{"question_id": "a89d7624", "question_type": "single-session-preference", "response": "Given your love of Denver's music scene and your plan to return for another concert, here are some tailored suggestions:\n\n**Music venues**\n- **Red Rocks Park and Amphitheatre** — the iconic spot where you saw The Killers; worth catching another show there.\n- **The Ogden Theatre** (LoDo) and **The Bluebird Theater** — historic venues with strong indie/rock lineups.\n- **The Fillmore Auditorium** — iconic room that hosted The Grateful Dead and Jimi Hendrix.\n- **Larimer Lounge** and **The hi-dive** — smaller, laid-back spots that are great for discovering new bands, which is right up your alley.\n- **The Marquis Theater** — mid-sized venue with a diverse rock/pop/electronic mix.\n\n**Festivals**\n- **Grandoozy** — big multi-genre festival (rock, pop, hip-hop, electronic).\n- **Westword Music Showcase** — one-day fest highlighting Denver's local scene.\n- **Riot Fest Denver** (September) — punk/rock/alternative, if your trip is later in the year.\n- **Denver Folk Festival** or **Denver Jazz Festival** if you want something different.\n\n**Dining near Red Rocks**\n- **The Ship Rock Grille** — your planned pre-show spot, just across the street; the patio has stunning amphitheater views (though not of the stage itself).\n- **The Village Tavern** (~5-min walk), **Morrison Inn** (~10-min walk), **The Fort** (~2 miles, Southwestern-inspired).\n\n**BBQ near Red Rocks**\n- **Wayne's Smoke Shack** in Morrison is just a few minutes away; **GQue BBQ** in Golden is 10–15 minutes.\n\n**Record shopping**\n- **Twist & Shout Records** — legendary store with an impressive vinyl and CD selection; perfect for feeding your new-band discovery habit.\n\nSince you're always looking for new music, I'd also suggest tracking artists on **Songkick** or **Bandsintown** so you can time your trip around a show you actually want to see.", "n_records": 46, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4085, "completion_tokens": 2033, "calls": 2}, "selected": ["self|concerts_attended_recently", "self|music_discovery_interest", "self|celebrity_encounter", "self|city_preference", "self|travel_plans", "self|dinner_plans", "assistant|band_recommendation", "assistant|music_discovery_tip", "assistant|denver_music_venue", "assistant|denver_music_festival", "assistant|denver_record_store", "assistant|bbq_near_red_rocks", "assistant|restaurant_near_red_rocks", "assistant|ship_rock_grille_details"], "digest_bytes": 5574}
